#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:917
msgid ""
"Improved support for abstract base classes containing descriptors composed "
"with abstract methods. The recommended approach to declaring abstract "
"descriptors is now to provide :attr:`!__isabstractmethod__` as a dynamically"
" updated property. The built-in descriptors have been updated accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Vylepsena podpora pro abstraktni bazove tridy obsahujici deskriptory "
"soucasne s abstraktnimi metodami. Doporucenym pristupem k deklarovani "
"abstraktnich deskriptoru je nyni poskytovat :attr:`!__isabstractmethod__` "
"jako dynamicky aktualizovanou vlastnost. Vestavane deskriptory byly "
"aktualizovany podle toho."

