msgid ""
":class:`abc.abstractproperty` has been deprecated, use :class:`property` "
"with :func:`abc.abstractmethod` instead."
msgstr ""
":class:`abc.abstractproperty` byla zastarala, pouzij :class:`property` s "
":func:`abc.abstractmethod` miste."

