#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:926 ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:2251
msgid ""
":class:`abc.abstractstaticmethod` has been deprecated, use "
":class:`staticmethod` with :func:`abc.abstractmethod` instead."
msgstr ""
