#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:986
msgid "codecs"
msgstr "codecs"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:988
msgid ""
"The :mod:`~encodings.mbcs` codec has been rewritten to handle correctly "
"``replace`` and ``ignore`` error handlers on all Windows versions.  The "
":mod:`~encodings.mbcs` codec now supports all error handlers, instead of "
"only ``replace`` to encode and ``ignore`` to decode."
msgstr ""
"Kodek :mod:`~encodings.mbcs` byl prepsan, aby spravne zpracoval ``replace`` "
"a ``ignore`` manipulatoru chyb na vsech verzich Windows. Kodek "
":mod:`~encodings.mbcs` nyni podporuje vse manipulatoru chyb, miste jenom "
"``replace`` pro kodovani a ``ignore`` pro dekodarni."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:993
msgid ""
"A new Windows-only codec has been added: ``cp65001`` (:issue:`13216`). It is"
" the Windows code page 65001 (Windows UTF-8, ``CP_UTF8``).  For example, it "
"is used by ``sys.stdout`` if the console output code page is set to cp65001 "
"(e.g., using ``chcp 65001`` command)."
msgstr ""
"Novy kodek pouze na Windows byl pridan: ``cp65001`` (:issue:`13216`). Je to "
"stranka kodu Windows 65001 (Windows UTF-8, ``CP_UTF8``). Napriklad je "
"pouzivana ``sys.stdout`` pokud je stranka kodu vykonu konzoly nastavena na "
"cp65001 (napriklad pouzitim prikazu ``chcp 65001``)."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:998
msgid ""
"Multibyte CJK decoders now resynchronize faster.  They only ignore the first"
" byte of an invalid byte sequence. For example, "
"``b'\\xff\\n'.decode('gb2312', 'replace')`` now returns a ``\\n`` after the "
"replacement character."
msgstr ""
"Multibyty CJK dekodery nyni synchronizuji rychleji. Ignoruji pouze prvni "
"byte neplatne byte sekvence. Napriklad, ``b'\\xff\\n'.decode('gb2312', "
"'replace')`` nyni vraci ``\\n`` po znaku nahrazeni."

