">>> print(m)\n"
"To: =?utf-8?q?=C3=89ric?= <foo@example.com>\n"
"Date: Fri, 25 May 2012 21:44:27 -0400\n"
"cc: pals: Bob <bob@example.com>, Sally <sally@example.com>;, Bonzo <bonz@laugh.com>"
