"spravne uciti vsechny znaky v retezci, ktere by mohly byt jinak dany "
"specialni vyznam shellem."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1789
msgid "shutil"
msgstr "shutil"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1791
msgid "New functions:"
msgstr "Nove funkce:"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1793
msgid ""
":func:`~shutil.disk_usage`: provides total, used and free disk space "
"statistics.  (Contributed by Giampaolo Rodolà in :issue:`12442`.)"
msgstr ""
":func:`~shutil.disk_usage`: poskytuje statistiku celkoveho, pouziteho a "
"volneho diskoveho prostoru. (Prispel Giampaolo Rodola v :issue:`12442`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1795
msgid ""
":func:`~shutil.chown`: allows one to change user and/or group of the given "
"path also specifying the user/group names and not only their numeric ids.  "
"(Contributed by Sandro Tosi in :issue:`12191`.)"
msgstr ""
":func:`~shutil.chown`: umoznuje zmenu uzivatele a/nebo skupiny dane cesty "
"take specifikovanim jmen uzivatel/skupin a ne pouze jejich numerickych id. "
"(Prispel Sandro Tosi v :issue:`12191`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1798
msgid ""
":func:`shutil.get_terminal_size`: returns the size of the terminal window to"
" which the interpreter is attached.  (Contributed by Zbigniew Jędrzejewski-"
"Szmek in :issue:`13609`.)"
msgstr ""
":func:`shutil.get_terminal_size`: vraci velikost okna terminalu, ke kteremu "
"je interpreter pripojen. (Prispel Zbigniew Jedrzejewski-Szmek v "
":issue:`13609`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1802
msgid ""
":func:`~shutil.copy2` and :func:`~shutil.copystat` now preserve file "
"timestamps with nanosecond precision on platforms that support it. They also"
" preserve file \"extended attributes\" on Linux.  (Contributed by Larry "
"Hastings in :issue:`14127` and  :issue:`15238`.)"
msgstr ""
":func:`~shutil.copy2` a :func:`~shutil.copystat` nyni uchovavaji cas souboru"
" s presnosti nanosekundy na platformach, ktere to podporuji. Jsou take "
"uchovavaji file \"extended attributes\" na Linuxu. (Prispel Larry Hastings v"
" :issue:`14127` a :issue:`15238`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1807
msgid ""
"Several functions now take an optional ``symlinks`` argument: when that "
"parameter is true, symlinks aren't dereferenced and the operation instead "
"acts on the symlink itself (or creates one, if relevant). (Contributed by "
"Hynek Schlawack in :issue:`12715`.)"
msgstr ""
"Nektere funkce nyni prijimaji volitelny ``symlinks`` argument: kdyz je tento"
" parametr pravda, symlinky nejsou dereferencovane a operace miste toho "
"jednajici na samotnem symlinku (nebo vytvoriti jeden, pokud je relevantni). "
"(Prispel Hynek Schlawack v :issue:`12715`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1812
msgid ""
"When copying files to a different file system, :func:`~shutil.move` now "
"handles symlinks the way the posix ``mv`` command does, recreating the "
"symlink rather than copying the target file contents.  (Contributed by "
"Jonathan Niehof in :issue:`9993`.)  :func:`~shutil.move` now also returns "
"the ``dst`` argument as its result."
msgstr ""
"Kdyz kopirujeme soubory na jiny souborovy system, :func:`~shutil.move` nyni "
"zpracovava symlinky tak jak to dela posix ``mv`` prikaz, recreation symlinku"
" spise nez koprovani obsahu ciloveho souboru. (Prispel Jonathan Niehof v "
":issue:`9993`.) :func:`~shutil.move` nyni take vraci ``dst`` argument jako "
"jeho vysledek."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1818
msgid ""
":func:`~shutil.rmtree` is now resistant to symlink attacks on platforms "
"which support the new ``dir_fd`` parameter in :func:`os.open` and "
":func:`os.unlink`.  (Contributed by Martin von Löwis and Hynek Schlawack in "
":issue:`4489`.)"
msgstr ""
":func:`~shutil.rmtree` je nyni odolna proti symlink utokum na platformach, "
"ktere podporuji novy ``dir_fd`` parametr v :func:`os.open` a "
":func:`os.unlink`. (Prispel Martin von Lewis a Hynek Schlawack v "
":issue:`4489`.)"

