#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1839
msgid ""
"The signal handler writes the signal number as a single byte instead of a "
"nul byte into the wakeup file descriptor. So it is possible to wait more "
"than one signal and know which signals were raised."
msgstr ""
"Handler signalu zapisuje cislo signalu jako jeden bajt namiste nul bajt do "
"wake-up deskriptoru souboru. Takze je mozne cekat vice nez jeden signal a "
"vedet ktere signaly byly vyvolvany."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1843
