" by Antoine Pitrou in :issue:`11183`.)"
msgstr ""
"Modul :mod:`ssl` nyni vystavuje jemnejsi-zrnita vyjimka hierarchie, aby se "
"snadneji inspektovat ruzne druhy chyb. (Prispel Antoine Pitrou v "
":issue:`11183`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1942
msgid ""
":meth:`~ssl.SSLContext.load_cert_chain` now accepts a *password* argument to"
" be used if the private key is encrypted. (Contributed by Adam Simpkins in "
":issue:`12803`.)"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~ssl.SSLContext.load_cert_chain` nyni prijima *password* argument, "
