"Pitrou in :issue:`13626` and :issue:`13627`.)"
msgstr ""
"Diffie-Hellman vyomena klice, jak regularni tak Elliptic Curve-based, je "
"nyni podporovana prostrednictvim metod "
":meth:`~ssl.SSLContext.load_dh_params` a "
":meth:`~ssl.SSLContext.set_ecdh_curve`. (Prispel Antoine Pitrou v "
":issue:`13626` a :issue:`13627`.)"

