":const:`~ssl.OP_NO_COMPRESSION` can be used to disable compression. "
"(Contributed by Antoine Pitrou in :issue:`13634`.)"
msgstr ""
"Muzes se ptat na SSL kompresi algoritmu pouziteho SSL socketem, diky jeho "
"nove metode :meth:`~ssl.SSLSocket.compression`. Novy atribut "
":const:`~ssl.OP_NO_COMPRESSION` muze byt pouzit k zakazani komprese. "
"(Prispel Antoine Pitrou v :issue:`13634`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1960
msgid ""
"Support has been added for the Next Protocol Negotiation extension using the"
