"(Contributed by Antoine Pitrou in :issue:`14837`.)"
msgstr ""
"SSL chyby mohou byt nyni inspektovany snazeji diky atributum "
":attr:`~ssl.SSLError.library` a :attr:`~ssl.SSLError.reason`. (Prispel "
"Antoine Pitrou v :issue:`14837`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1968
